{{Passive skill box|Overwhelm}}
{{for}}
'''Overwhelm''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Slayer]] that sets the base [[critical strike]] chance of the equipped weapon to 8%, grants critical strike multiplier per nearby enemy, and lowers the critical strike multiplier of nearby enemies.

This passive only overrides the ''weapon'''s critical strike chance value.<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexile/comments/bw2bpl/deleted_by_user/eq16ie3/?context=2</ref> It does not prevent additional flat critical strike chance from other sources, for example {{il|Increased Critical Strikes Support}} or {{stl|Brittle}}. 

==Ruthless mode==
{{infocard
